      "type": "math",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 172,
      "raw": "$$\nP(\\mathbf{Y} \\mid \\mathbf{X}) = \\prod_{i=1}^n P(\\mathbf{y}^{(i)} \\mid \\mathbf{x}^{(i)}).\n$$",
