      "type": "math",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 178,
      "raw": "$$\n-\\log P(\\mathbf{Y} \\mid \\mathbf{X}) = \\sum_{i=1}^n -\\log P(\\mathbf{y}^{(i)} \\mid \\mathbf{x}^{(i)})\n= \\sum_{i=1}^n l(\\mathbf{y}^{(i)}, \\hat{\\mathbf{y}}^{(i)}),\n$$",
      "math": {
