      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 183,
      "raw": "其中，对于任何标签$\\mathbf{y}$和模型预测$\\hat{\\mathbf{y}}$，损失函数为：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 2,
        "rendered": 2,
        "errors": 0,
