      "type": "math",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 215,
      "raw": "$$\n\\partial_{o_j} l(\\mathbf{y}, \\hat{\\mathbf{y}}) = \\frac{\\exp(o_j)}{\\sum_{k=1}^q \\exp(o_k)} - y_j = \\mathrm{softmax}(\\mathbf{o})_j - y_j.\n$$",
